  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of a five-year Strategic Plan for the Inter-faith intervention in HIV and AIDS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The HIV &amp; AIDS Inter-Faith Strategy for Sierra Leone will help to secure a sustainable and quality response from various religious and faith based organizations to respond to the issue of HIV &amp; AIDS in the country. It is widely recognized and believed that Sierra Leoneans value their faiths and their faiths influence their behaviors to a large extent.</narrative>
  </description>
